From: dvbondoy <dvbondoy@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:24:50 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Design doc: Hello, the example program (proposed)

flickos-hello.md proposes a small package that has every part a FlickOS
program has, once: a setting with a system default and a user's choice,
the command line first, a window, History, a Settings tile, tests and a
boot-test check. It is a Recommends of flickos-desktop (an app users may
remove), found from Settings through a More Settings tile rather than
the Settings menu, and it records its changes for History, so
flickos-control changes with it. No spike: every part exists already.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
